Limitations
- Completion is not validity: v0.30 cannot support inferential claims.
- Four model protocol failures remain in the immutable evidence; no selective
  rerun, threshold change, protocol repair, or post hoc censoring was applied.
- Flash missed one seed-specific clean-readiness gate.
- Both models share OpenCode Go and the DeepSeek V4 family, so provider effects,
  cross-provider generalization, and cross-family generalization are not
  identified.
- Catalog listings are not immutable serving-weight hashes, and the provider
  exposes no executable unified sampling seed.
